\u1eb7c \nnhi\n\u1ec1u \nCIs \nkh\u00e1\nc \nth\u00e0\nnh \nc\u00f4n\ng \ns\u1eed\nd\n\u1ee5ng \nl\u1ef1a \nch\n\u1ecdn \nt\u1ea1o \nRel\nati\nons\nhip \nb\n\u1eb1\nng \nc\u00e1c\nh \nt\u00ecm \nki\n\u1ebfm \nCIs\n\u0110\u0103\nng \nnh\n\u1eadp, \ntruy \nc\u1eadp \nmo\ndul\ne \nCM\nDB, \nm\u1edf\nchi \nti\u1ebft \nth\u00f4\nng \ntin \n1 CI \nthe\no \nm\u00f4 \nt\u1ea3\nt\u1ea1i \nUS \nCM\nDB-\n743\n, \nclic\nk \nTAB \nC\u00e1c \nm\u1ed1i \nqua\nn \nh\u1ec7\n(Rel\natio\nnsh\nip)\nUser \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n quy\u1ec1n ch\u1ec9nh \ns\u1eeda CI\nC\u00e1c CI \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \nquan h\u1ec7 ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7\nn\u00e0o v\u1edbi CI hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00f3.\nStep 1: M\u00e0n h\u00ecnh TAB C\u00e1c \nm\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7\n(Relationship) hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb\nv\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\u00e1c th\u00e0nh \nph\u1ea7n m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 t\u1ea1i 3.1 >> \nClick button Th\u00eam quan \nh\u1ec7 / Add Relationship.\nStep 2: C\u1eeda s\u1ed5 Th\u00eam \nquan h\u1ec7 / Add \nRelationship hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb, \nch\u1ecdn T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm CIs. C\u1eeda \ns\u1ed5 T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm CIs hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb.\nStep 3: T\u1ea1i select field CI \nTypes, th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n select \ntype b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3, t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng \nv\u1edbi CI Type \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ecdn, danh \ns\u00e1ch c\u00e1c CIs hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb t\u1ea1i \nDanh s\u00e1ch CIs / Available \nCI(s)\u00a0 l\u00e0 c\u00e1c CIs thu\u1ed9c \nType \u0111\u00f3 (tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p t\u1ea1i \nCI Types ch\u1ecdn gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb m\u1eb7c \n\u0111\u1ecbnh All CIs, danh s\u00e1ch \nhi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb l\u00e0 to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 c\u00e1c CIs \nc\u00f3 tr\u00ean h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng).\nStep 4: T\u1ea1i Search \nBox\u00a0th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nh\u1eadp t\u00ean 1 \nCI b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 v\u00e0 click button \nSearch, Danh s\u00e1ch CIs / \nAvailable CI(s) hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb\nch\u1ec9 CI th\u1ecfa m\u00e3n \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n \nt\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm (theo CI name).\nStep 5: ch\u1ecdn CI v\u1eeba t\u00ecm \nki\u1ebfm th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, click \nMove Right \u0111\u1ec3 chuy\u1ec3n CI \n\u0111\u00f3 sang danh s\u00e1ch Danh \ns\u00e1ch CIs \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ecdn / \nSelected CIs.\nStep 6: l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i step 3,4,5 \nv\u1edbi CI Type kh\u00e1c v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn \nv\u00e0i CIs kh\u00e1c (test multi \nselect) sang Danh s\u00e1ch \nCIs \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ecdn / Selected \nCIs.\nTh\u00eam m\u1edbi m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 th\u00e0nh \nc\u00f4ng, c\u00e1c m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 hi\u1ec3n \nth\u1ecb t\u1ea1i TAB Relationship c\u1ee7a CI \nhi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111ang kh\u1edfi t\u1ea1o \nrelationship.\nT\u1ea1i c\u00e1c CI \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o quan h\u1ec7\nt\u1edbi CI hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb c\u00e1c m\u1ed1i \nquan h\u1ec7 ngh\u1ecbch \u0111\u1ea3o v\u1edbi CI \nhi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1903, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "de2179ca-baef-49f2-a046-aaa6afcccfdc", "embedding": [-0.06829419732093811, 0.09194886684417725, -0.04462389275431633, -0.0250534825026989, 0.0019970471039414406, -0.03213116154074669, -0.021995067596435547, -0.021129507571458817, 0.0028066288214176893, 0.0016129312571138144, 0.03607654571533203, -0.05035535618662834, 0.011714217253029346, -0.02030242048203945, 0.06161598488688469, 0.05559978634119034, -0.005219819024205208, 0.006046322640031576, -0.010706680826842785, 0.014663842506706715, 0.034288279712200165, -0.019953884184360504, -0.0338357649743557, -0.044970639050006866, 0.020064206793904305, 0.044300295412540436, 0.010404492728412151, -0.06402197480201721, 0.002844159957021475, -0.15588805079460144, 0.0068807415664196014, 0.06345486640930176, 0.05122535303235054, -0.028358612209558487, 0.048306118696928024, -0.03651688992977142, 0.006733835209161043, -0.021740317344665527, -0.028466932475566864